{
  "format": 1,
  "package": "s6c",
  "profile": "s6c-29.338-ordinary-mme-slice-v1",
  "version": "0.1.0-slice.23",
  "sources": [
    "3GPP TS 29.338 V18.2.0, S6c SRR/SRA ordinary MSISDN/MME subset",
    "doc/diameterkit-protocol-vectors.md V-SRR-01 V-SRA-01 V-SRA-02",
    "RFC 6733 sections 6.2, 6.7, 6.11, 7.1-7.5; verified errata 4615/4887; common E grammar revision 2",
    "generated envelope operations v2: finite snapshot, Session/Proxy correlation, explicit normal/error sources",
    "3GPP TS 29.338 section 6.3: Supported-Features structure only; no negotiation state; SMS VSAI receive-ignore/send-forbid",
    "generated envelope operations v3: Destination presence/value extraction for fixed runtime binding; no destination override",
    "generated operations v4: CanonicalV1 on validated raw request; known identity folding, ordered groups, stable independent top-level keys and unknown barriers",
    "generated operations v5: explicit per-command fixed-terminal transport replay permission; ordinary S6c SRR only, requires configured target and retention domain; Base controls excluded",
    "generated operations v6: explicit no_context audit for existing static rules plus original-request association; no additional application facts in this slice",
    "3GPP TS 29.338 V18.2.0 sections 5.2.2/5.2.3, 5.3.1.2, 5.3.2.5-8, 5.3.3.14-22 and 7: ordinary MSISDN RDR/RDA and HSS ALR/ALA slice; doc vectors V-RDR-01/V-RDA-01..03/V-ALR-01/V-ALA-01..02",
    "3GPP TS 29.336 User-Identifier 10415/3102: this slice only MSISDN 10415/701, numeric TBCD up to 15 digits; no T4/IMS identities",
    "manual RDR/ALR rules revision 1: one MME outcome with cause 0/1/2; optional absent diagnostic 13 only, other diagnostics unsupported; unsigned flags receive-preserve/send-known; HSS ALR requires Destination-Host and excludes SMSMI/Alert-Event/Serving-Node",
    "manual result rules revision 3: ExperimentalResult structure shared, command-specific SRA 5001 and RDA 5001/5558; ALA no experimental application errors; optional Alert MSISDN only on RDA success",
    "generator v7: named avp.Time primitive, exact four-octet NTP seconds without era inference; operation contract remains ops6; no transport replay permission for RDR or ALR",
    "manual ordinary-HSS routing revision4: TS29.338 V18.2.0 sections5.2.1.1/3,5.3.3.2-8; IMSI-success only, five SGSN/MME/MSC shapes for distinct2401/2406 types, cross-group SGSN+MSC/MME, original SRR3310 bit0 required for additional node; not Router rewrite or SMSF fallback semantics",
    "manual request revision2: optional MTI0/1, flags bits0..2 send-known receive-preserve, GPRS bit0 requires3309, finite decimal international SME Length/TOA0x91/TBCD1..15 digits; no SC/MSISDN inference; other TON/NPI unsupported",
    "manual success adjunct revision1: LMSI4 octets and Alert UserIdentifier/MSISDN plus raw MWD bits0..4; never synthesize missing conditional data, no HSS/VLR history or MWD storage",
    "generator9/ops8 unchanged; generated CheckAnswer checks paired routing eligibility; existing SRR transport-replay permission remains fixed-terminal transport-only, not SM delivery retry",
    "manual report revision2: ordinary MSISDN RDR supports MME/MSC/SGSN productive outcomes; cause0..2 required in each selected group, MME and MSC mutually exclusive; diagnostic only with cause1, MSC0/1/2/3/4/9/13, SGSN2/5/6/7/8/10/13, prior MME13; other diagnostics unsupported; RDA2001/10415-5001/5558 retain separate namespaces; no MWD store or report/alert scheduler",
    "manual alert revision2: TS29.338 sections5.3.3.23 and6.2.3; ALR-specific UserIdentifier ordinary MSISDN HSS or decimal IMSI access-node shape, bitmask1/2/3, optional moved-to MME/SGSN (cross-RAT allowed); explicit bounded S6cAlertRole endpoints/context required for MME/SGSN, never infer origin role from DRA or new node; no T4/Router token/legacy SGd App or scheduling; existing HSS zero context preserved",
    "manual report/alert revision3: TS29.338 table5.2.3.1-1 and5.2.2.1-1; distinct ReportUserIdentifier Optional IMSI/MSISDN XOR; fixed S6cT4NoMSISDN evidence binds procedure, terminal endpoints, IMSI and SC; no history lookup",
    "ALR IMSI without event is wire-possible HSS T4 but needs explicit T4 purpose; access roles still require3333 and exclude3329; T4 excludes3333/2401/SMSMI; SRA/RDA Alert-MSISDN type unchanged; generator9/ops8 unchanged",
    "manual routing revision3: TS29.338 table5.2.1.1-1/2; SRR Optional top-level IMSI/MSISDN XOR; bounded T4Routing via existing S6cT4NoMSISDN purpose/endpoint/IMSI/SC evidence; success SRA IMSI matches original known IMSI; selected nodes and GPRS/SMEA conditions unchanged; no IMS/Router rewriting or history",
    "manual SRA result revision4: TS29.338 table5.2.1.1-2, sections5.2.1.3/5.3.3.9-11/7; experimental10415 5001/5550/5552/5556/5557;5550 permits bounded IMSI/Alert-MSISDN/MWD/three domain diagnostics, no serving nodes/LMSI; explicit S6cRoutingRole plus external UNRI fact for IP-SM-GW required-IMSI condition, never inferred from SRR flags; reserved diagnostic receive-and-report, send selected values only",
    "manual routing revision5: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table5.2.1.1-2/5.3.3.6-7/5.3.3.39 and TS29.3366.4.14-15/18; SRA Serving-Node known-IMSI N/NH/NB/NHB with SBI0/1; Realm/Additional IP-SM-GW and reserved SBI owned receive plus Unsupported context, standard send rejects; no compatibility activation or ALR widening; original SRR additional-node permission unchanged",
    "manual report revision4: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table5.2.3.1-1/2 and5.3.3.14/18-20; ordinary-MSISDN RDR 3316/3320 cause0/1/2, optional cause1 diagnostic11/12 selected from TS23.040 V18.0.0 3.3.2 table1a; all four productive parent combinations except MSC+MME; unknown cause/0..255 diagnostics owned receive plus Unsupported context, malformed fields rejected; no IMS/T4 expansion or MWD/history service",
    "manual report revision5: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table5.2.3.1-1 and6.3.3.1/13-16; IMS no-MSISDN RDR UserIdentifier/UserName is HSS-ID (TS23.003 V18.5.0 5.3 digits6..15), SMSMI3324 contains only required destination3327 UTF8String V1/M0; explicit bounded IMSDeliveryReport evidence, exact URI/SC/identity binding; selected ASCII SIP user@DNS <=256 bytes; no resolver, generic SIP stack or retry history; generator9/ops8 unchanged",
    "manual alert revision3: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table5.2.2.1-1/2 and6.3.3.13-16; IMS HSS-to-IWMSC ALR uses exact fifteen-zero dummy MSISDN per TS23.003 V18.5.0 3.3 plus destination-only SMSMI3324/3327 V1/M0; dedicated IMSHSSAlert evidence binds URI/SC/endpoints, no HSS-ID/IMSI,3333 or2401. Optional raw3329 Time unchanged; no MWD/retry scheduling or time inference; generator9/ops8 unchanged",
    "manual routing revision6: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table5.2.1.1-1/2 and5.3.1.1.2; IMS SRR top-level UserName is HSS-ID, destination-only SMSMI3324/3327 V1/M0; dedicated IMSRouting binds role/HSSID/URI/SC/endpoints and optional IP-SM-GW UNRI, successful SRA retains real IMSI/selected nodes rather than request equality; no HSS-ID echo fallback, no-IMSI success, Router token or discovery. Fixed same-HSS transport replay audited with unchanged request identity/context and per-attempt budgets; generator9/ops8 unchanged",
    "manual T4 report revision8: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table5.2.3.1-1/2 and5.3.3.14/18-20; noMSISDN/knownIMSI following T4 Submit Trigger enables selected IP-SM-GW outcome3320, cause0/1/2 and optional cause1diagnostic11/12, alone or with existing legal MME/MSC/SGSN parents. Existing T4DeliveryReport evidence binds GMSC/HSS, originalIMSI/SC; no new Context, identity inference or result branches. Reserved cause/diagnostic receive-and-report, send selected only; no MWD/history/scheduling/persistence/replay; generator9/ops8 unchanged",
    "manual alert revision4: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table6.2.3.1-1/2 and6.2.3.4; Router-to-GMSC ALR UserIdentifier/UserName is exact priorTFA token, not IMSI. Bounded RouterAlert assertion binds original token, priorTFR SMS-GMSC-Address and Router/GMSC endpoints; local UTF8/noNUL1..256byte subset, no normalization or lookup. Wire UserName syntax broadened; access role still requires decimalIMSI5..15 and HSS/T4/IMS unchanged. No SGd TFA token output, MCCMNC/SRA rewriting, business replay or persistence; generator13/ops8 unchanged. LegacySGd fixed delegate inherits source fingerprint.",
    "manual routing revision9: TS29.338 table5.2.1.1-1/2 and5.3.3.5; explicit RouterHPLMN success token and MSISDN-only MCCMNC query (3311=1), selected UTF8 token1..256; success node condition paired with original request; ordinary/T4/IMS identity remains decimal, no lookup or business mapping",
    "Batch108 reviewed SRR flag-bit0 SM-RP-SMEA omission: receive-only named conditional evidence; minimum3 zero bytes from the existing selected SMEA syntax, no new presence/value rule. Generatorv22/ops9 unchanged."
  ],
